# 源自 docs/bugs/0037（有脚注定义的文档整篇进不了就地编辑）—— 脚注引用/定义的编号、重复、未定义与行内嵌套
{"id":"buginl-0037-ref-basic","name":"单个脚注引用与定义","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"正文[^1]\n\n[^1]: 脚注正文\n"},"expect":{"contains":["<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn-1\" id=\"fnref-1\" data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup>","<section class=\"footnotes\" data-footnotes>","class=\"footnote-backref\"","<p>脚注正文 "],"counts":{"<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn-1\" id=\"fnref-1\" data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup>":1,"<section class=\"footnotes\" data-footnotes>":1,"<li id=\"fn-1\">":1}}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-ref-multi","name":"两个脚注按引用编号","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"a[^1] b[^2]\n\n[^1]: 一\n[^2]: 二\n"},"expect":{"contains":["id=\"fnref-2\"","<p>一 ","<p>二 "],"counts":{"<sup class=\"footnote-ref\">":2,"<li id=\"fn-1\">":1,"<li id=\"fn-2\">":1}}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-ref-dup","name":"同一脚注引用两次生成两个锚","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"a[^1] b[^1]\n\n[^1]: 同\n"},"expect":{"contains":["id=\"fnref-1\"","id=\"fnref-1-2\""],"counts":{"<sup class=\"footnote-ref\">":3,"<li id=\"fn-1\">":1}}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-ref-order-reversed","name":"引用顺序决定显示序号","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"a[^2] b[^1]\n\n[^1]: 一\n[^2]: 二\n"},"expect":{"contains":["href=\"#fn-2\"","href=\"#fn-1\"","data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup> b<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn-1\" id=\"fnref-1\" data-footnote-ref>2</a>"],"counts":{"<li id=\"fn-2\">":1,"<li id=\"fn-1\">":1}}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-ref-undefined","name":"未定义脚注引用保持字面","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"正文[^nope]\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p>正文[^nope]</p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-def-only","name":"只有脚注定义时输出为空","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"[^1]: 只有定义\n"},"expect":{"equals":""}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-ref-only","name":"只有引用没有定义时保持字面","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"只有引用[^1]\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p>只有引用[^1]</p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-label-cjk","name":"中文脚注标签","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"正文[^注]\n\n[^注]: 中文脚注\n"},"expect":{"contains":["href=\"#fn-%E6%B3%A8\"","id=\"fn-%E6%B3%A8\"","<p>中文脚注 "],"counts":{"<section class=\"footnotes\" data-footnotes>":1}}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-label-num","name":"数字脚注标签","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"正文[^42]\n\n[^42]: 数字\n"},"expect":{"contains":["id=\"fn-42\"","id=\"fnref-42\"","<p>数字 "]}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-label-mixed-case","name":"大小写混合脚注标签","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"正文[^AbC]\n\n[^abc]: 大小写\n"},"expect":{"contains":["id=\"fn-abc\"","id=\"fnref-abc\"","<p>大小写 "]}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-label-underscore","name":"下划线脚注标签","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"正文[^a_b]\n\n[^a_b]: 下划线\n"},"expect":{"contains":["id=\"fn-a_b\"","<p>下划线 "]}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-label-space","name":"带空格的脚注标签退化成引用式链接","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"正文[^a b]\n\n[^a b]: 空格\n"},"expect":{"contains":["<a href=\"%E7%A9%BA%E6%A0%BC\">^a b</a>"],"not_contains":["footnote-ref"]}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-label-hyphen","name":"连字符脚注标签","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"正文[^a-b]\n\n[^a-b]: 连字符\n"},"expect":{"contains":["id=\"fn-a-b\"","<p>连字符 "]}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-multipara-def","name":"多段脚注定义","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"a[^1]\n\n[^1]: 第一段\n\n    第二段\n"},"expect":{"contains":["<p>第一段</p>","<p>第二段 ","class=\"footnote-backref\""],"counts":{"<section class=\"footnotes\" data-footnotes>":1}}}
