{"id":"buginl-0037-def-with-footnote-ref","name":"脚注定义里再引用另一个脚注","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"a[^1]\n\n[^1]: 注[^2]\n\n[^2]: 二\n"},"expect":{"contains":["id=\"fnref-2\"","<li id=\"fn-2\">","<p>二 "],"counts":{"<section class=\"footnotes\" data-footnotes>":1}}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-in-list","name":"列表项里的脚注引用","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"- 项[^1]\n\n[^1]: 注\n"},"expect":{"contains":["<li>项<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn-1\" id=\"fnref-1\" data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup></li>","<section class=\"footnotes\" data-footnotes>","class=\"footnote-backref\""]}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-in-blockquote","name":"引用块里的脚注引用","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"> 引用[^1]\n\n[^1]: 注\n"},"expect":{"contains":["<blockquote>\n<p>引用<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn-1\" id=\"fnref-1\" data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup></p>\n</blockquote>","<section class=\"footnotes\" data-footnotes>"]}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-in-table-cell","name":"表格单元格里的脚注引用","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"| a |\n| - |\n| x[^1] |\n\n[^1]: 注\n"},"expect":{"contains":["<td>x<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn-1\" id=\"fnref-1\" data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup></td>","<section class=\"footnotes\" data-footnotes>"]}}
{"id":"buginl-0037-in-heading","name":"标题里的脚注引用","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"# 标题[^1]\n\n[^1]: 注\n"},"expect":{"contains":["<h1>标题<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn-1\" id=\"fnref-1\" data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup></h1>","<section class=\"footnotes\" data-footnotes>"]}}
# ⚠️ 疑似缺陷：脚注引用嵌在链接文字里会生成 <a> 套 <a> 的非法结构，浏览器会拆开外层链接
