# 源自 docs/bugs/0081（假后端不归一化行尾和 BOM 导致探针假红）—— 渲染层对 BOM/CRLF 的归一化
{"id":"buginl-0081-bom-before-strong","name":"BOM 后的加粗正常解析","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"﻿**粗**\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><strong>粗</strong></p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0081-bom-before-em","name":"BOM 后的斜体正常解析","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"﻿*斜*\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><em>斜</em></p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0081-bom-before-link","name":"BOM 后的链接正常解析","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"﻿[x](u)\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><a href=\"u\">x</a></p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0081-bom-before-heading","name":"BOM 后的标题正常解析","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"﻿# 标题\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<h1>标题</h1>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0081-bom-crlf","name":"BOM 与 CRLF 同时出现","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"﻿**粗**\r\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><strong>粗</strong></p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0081-bom-mid-doc","name":"文档中间的 BOM 是零宽字符","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"a﻿*b*c\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p>a﻿<em>b</em>c</p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0081-crlf-em","name":"CRLF 文档里的强调","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"*a*\r\n**b**\r\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><em>a</em><br />\n<strong>b</strong></p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0081-crlf-code","name":"CRLF 文档里的行内代码","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"`a`\r\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><code>a</code></p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0081-crlf-link","name":"CRLF 文档里的链接","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"[x](u)\r\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><a href=\"u\">x</a></p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0081-crlf-image","name":"CRLF 文档里的图片","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"![a](i.png)\r\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><img src=\"i.png\" alt=\"a\" /></p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0081-crlf-del","name":"CRLF 文档里的删除线","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"~~a~~\r\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><del>a</del></p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0081-crlf-mixed-eol","name":"LF/CRLF 混排的强调","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"*a*\nb\r\n*c*\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><em>a</em><br />\nb<br />\n<em>c</em></p>\n"}}

# 源自 docs/bugs/0058（Cmd-点击链接不打开）、0001（点击链接导致应用自行重载）—— 裸 URL 自动链接的尾随标点边界（ASCII 与全角对照）
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-ascii-period","name":"裸 URL 后的 ASCII 句号被裁掉","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"见 https://e.com/a.\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p>见 <a href=\"https://e.com/a\">https://e.com/a</a>.</p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-ascii-comma","name":"裸 URL 后的 ASCII 逗号被裁掉","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"见 https://e.com/a, 然后\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p>见 <a href=\"https://e.com/a\">https://e.com/a</a>, 然后</p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-ascii-paren","name":"裸 URL 后的 ASCII 右括号被裁掉","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"(见 https://e.com/a)\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p>(见 <a href=\"https://e.com/a\">https://e.com/a</a>)</p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-ascii-colon","name":"裸 URL 后的 ASCII 冒号被裁掉","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"见 https://e.com/a: 然后\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p>见 <a href=\"https://e.com/a\">https://e.com/a</a>: 然后</p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-ascii-semicolon","name":"裸 URL 后的 ASCII 分号被裁掉","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"见 https://e.com/a;\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p>见 <a href=\"https://e.com/a\">https://e.com/a</a>;</p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-ascii-question","name":"裸 URL 后的 ASCII 问号被裁掉","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"见 https://e.com/a?\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p>见 <a href=\"https://e.com/a\">https://e.com/a</a>?</p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-ascii-bang","name":"裸 URL 后的 ASCII 叹号被裁掉","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"见 https://e.com/a!\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p>见 <a href=\"https://e.com/a\">https://e.com/a</a>!</p>\n"}}
# ⚠️ 疑似缺陷：裸 URL 后紧跟的全角句号被吞进链接目标；ASCII 句号会被裁掉，中文句子里的链接因此指向错误地址
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-cjk-period","name":"裸 URL 后的全角句号被吞进链接","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"见 https://e.com/a。\n"},"expect":{"contains":["href=\"https://e.com/a%E3%80%82\""]}}
# ⚠️ 疑似缺陷：裸 URL 后紧跟的全角逗号与其后文字被整段吞进链接目标
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-cjk-comma","name":"裸 URL 后的全角逗号被吞进链接","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"见 https://e.com/a，然后用\n"},"expect":{"contains":["href=\"https://e.com/a%EF%BC%8C%E7%84%B6%E5%90%8E%E7%94%A8\""]}}
# ⚠️ 疑似缺陷：裸 URL 后紧跟的全角冒号与其后文字被整段吞进链接目标
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-cjk-colon","name":"裸 URL 后的全角冒号被吞进链接","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"见 https://e.com/a：然后\n"},"expect":{"contains":["href=\"https://e.com/a%EF%BC%9A%E7%84%B6%E5%90%8E\""]}}
# ⚠️ 疑似缺陷：裸 URL 后的全角右括号被吞进链接目标，与 ASCII 右括号的处理不一致
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-cjk-paren","name":"裸 URL 后的全角右括号被吞进链接","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"（见 https://e.com/a）\n"},"expect":{"contains":["href=\"https://e.com/a%EF%BC%89\""]}}
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-cjk-space","name":"裸 URL 后的全角空格截断链接","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"见 https://e.com/a　然后\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p>见 <a href=\"https://e.com/a%E3%80%80%E7%84%B6%E5%90%8E\">https://e.com/a　然后</a></p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-in-strong","name":"加粗里的裸 URL","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"**https://e.com/a。**\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><strong><a href=\"https://e.com/a%E3%80%82\">https://e.com/a。</a></strong></p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-in-em","name":"斜体里的裸 URL","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"*https://e.com/a。*\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><em><a href=\"https://e.com/a%E3%80%82\">https://e.com/a。</a></em></p>\n"}}
{"id":"buginl-0058-bare-query-amp","name":"裸 URL 查询串里的 & 被转义","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"https://e.com/?a=1&b=2\n"},"expect":{"equals":"<p><a href=\"https://e.com/?a=1&amp;b=2\">https://e.com/?a=1&amp;b=2</a></p>\n"}}

# 源自 docs/bugs/0075（超长图类型把回退提示撑到 900 字节）—— 行内/块级公式的结构边界与回退
{"id":"buginl-0075-math-inline","name":"行内公式输出 MathML 容器","family":"bugs-inline","check":"html","input":{"md":"$x$\n"},"expect":{"contains":["<span class=\"rmd-math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><math","<annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation>"],"not_contains":["rmd-math-display"]}}
